WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/vehicles/components/vehicle-detail/RecentChargesSection.tsx (93 lines):
    <GlassPanel p-6>
      <header> BatteryCharging(neon-green) + <span text-lg bold>Recent Charges</span>
               <Link to="/charging"> View all <ChevronRight/> </Link> </header>
      sessions && length > 0
        ? <DataTable tableId="vehicles:detail-recent-charges" compact pagination columns={useChargeColumns()}
                     data={sessions} keyExtractor={s => s.id} emptyMessage={t('common.noCharges', …)} />
        : <EmptyState icon={BatteryCharging} message={t('common.noCharges', 'No charging sessions recorded yet')} />
    </GlassPanel>
  useChargeColumns() (local hook) → 5 columns, each a `render`:
    date     → formatDateTime(s.start_ts)                                   (dateFormat.ts: medium date + short time, '—' on nil)
    energy   → `${fmtNumber(convertEnergyFromSI(s.total_energy_added_wh ?? 0, 'kWh'))} kWh`   (wh/1000, global precision)
    duration → durationStr(s.duration_min)                                  (helpers.ts: floor(min/60) "h", fmtInt(min%60) "m")
    cost     → s.cost != null ? formatCurrency(s.cost) : '—'                (useFormatting: `${symbol}${fmtNumber(amount,prec)}`)
    battery  → s.end_soc_pct != null ? `${start}% → ${end}%` : `${start}%`  (bare SOC numbers, U+2192 arrow)
  Hooks    : useChargeColumns (local), useTranslation, useFormatting (formatCurrency + currencySymbol + precision).
  i18n keys: common.{date,energy,duration,cost,battery,recentCharges,viewAll,noCharges}.
  The web leaf has only the table / empty branches; the P4 leaf contract adds loading / error / stale / offline.

