  <DataTable>                 → Grid/GridRow columnar (macOS/regular) + stacked card list (compact iPhone), aligned by column
  <EmptyState>                → ContentUnavailableView(battery glyph + localized noCharges)
  fmtNumber / fmtInt          → RecentChargesNumber.number/integer (NumberFormatter .decimal, grouping, halfUp, safeNumber)
  convertEnergyFromSI(wh,kWh) → RecentChargesNumber.kilowattHours = wh/1000 (verbatim divisor)
  durationStr(min)            → RecentChargesDuration.split + "%1$@h %2$@m" | "%@m" templates
  formatCurrency              → RecentChargesNumber.currency = symbol + fmtNumber(amount, precision)
  formatDateTime              → RecentChargesDateFormat (DateFormatter .medium + .short, injected locale + tz, nil ⇒ '—')
  battery `${a}% → ${b}%`     → "%1$@%% → %2$@%%" | "%@%%" with `plain` bare SOC numbers
  i18n                        → every string via RecentChargesStrings (table "RecentChargesSection", web t(key,default) fallback);
                                the 8 source keys preserved verbatim (common.date/energy/duration/cost/battery/recentCharges/viewAll/noCharges)
  a11y                        → panel .contain labelled by model.accessibilitySummary; each row one element "{header}: {value}, …";
                                "View all" / retry labelled; Dynamic Type via tokens; Reduce Motion honoured by TSFadeIn
  telemetry                   → view.opened surface="RecentChargesSection" emitted once from RecentChargesModel first snapshot (P1/S11)

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface)
  loading   → skeleton bars under the live header (first load, no cached rows).
  empty     → ContentUnavailableView (battery glyph + "No charging sessions recorded yet"), never blank.
  error     → retryable QueryError-equivalent chrome (first-load failure with no rows).
  content   → the adaptive 5-column table; a reload failure with rows still showing surfaces an inline ErrorText.
  stale     → header chip + banner + one-shot auto-refresh on the live→stale transition.
  offline   → header chip + banner over the cached rows; no auto-refresh.

